":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibility(activationPoint:)-8r8b9":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibility(activationPoint:)-8r8b9","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibility(activationpoint:)-8r8b9","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibility","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"activationPoint"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnitPoint","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI9UnitPointV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ModifiedContent","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"deprecated":true,"type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"accessibility(activationPoint:)"},"doc://sama